							"Next Scene: The camera slowly pans from her feet to her face, focusing on the rhythmic movements of her embroidered skirt as she twirls. The lighting creates a dramatic interplay of shadows and golden hues across the textured stage floor.  ",
							"Next Scene: A distant shot shows the dancer performing in the center of a bustling street, surrounded by onlookers dressed in traditional attire. The cobblestone road and wooden storefronts frame the scene, evoking a vibrant marketplace atmosphere.  ",
